From 248fa4c3214dd1b66eba0d1970097c56631fa7f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 22:03:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] fix(mode-row): the correction toggle is not shown on the
 ladder rungs, where it did nothing
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The mode row hid its dictation group on the 认读 / 打拼音 / 选汉字 rungs but kept the correction
group, and the toggle was inert there: 认读 and 选汉字 type nothing, and the 打拼音 box rolls a
wrong letter back whatever the setting (d-more.cjs: Backspace mode active, "shx" rolled back
to "sh"). The row is left out on the ladder rungs, as it already is in focus mode; 输入法 and
the Latin box keep both groups.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/App.tsx | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/App.tsx b/src/App.tsx
index 402d2fa..0301d12 100644
--- a/src/App.tsx
+++ b/src/App.tsx
@@ -2373,7 +2373,9 @@ export default function Home() {
